@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #FCE8E0
autonumber
participant "ApiAnalyticsPage / analyticsApi" as P0 <<boundary>>
participant "AnalyticsController" as P1 <<controller>>
participant "AnalyticsService" as P2 <<service>>
participant "AnalyticsRepository" as P3 <<repository>>
participant "GameSession / CoordinationResult" as P4 <<entity>>
P0 -> P1: Request an AI comparison
P1 -> P2: Check comparison filters
alt explicit human/replay source and valid filters
P2 -> P3: Load encounter metrics
P3 -> P4: Read encounter data
P3 --> P2: Return encounter metrics
P2 -> P3: Load coordination metrics
P3 -> P4: Read coordination data
P3 --> P2: Return solve metrics
note over P2,P4: Merge encounter and solve metrics by content version and comparison group.
P2 --> P1: Return comparison results
P1 --> P0: Display the comparison
else missing source or invalid filter
P2 --> P1: Reject invalid filters
P1 --> P0: Display filter errors
end
@enduml